<title>HONG KONG: APT Satellite seeks listing in Hong Kong.</title>
<headline>APT Satellite seeks listing in Hong Kong.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Satellite service provider APT Satellite Holdings Ltd said on Monday it intends to make an initial public offering of its shares, including American Depositary Shares (ADS).</p>
<p>It said in a statement it has applied to list in the Hong Kong bourse and would apply to list the ADS on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Proceeds of the offer, estimated at US$250 million, would be used to repay bank debts of about US$170 million with the remainder to finance the construction and launch of future satellites.</p>
<p>--HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 28436441</p>
